child reaches the write path and faults inside it: the trail measures verdict 0 with alive 71, write-cap 1, block-cap 0 and read 72, so the capability lookup, the elevation and the servicer call all work in a spawned process. os-backlog.md row 'A spawned child exercising an inherited FileSystem.Write capability CRASHES' (measured 2026-09-08). Un-skip with the fix; expected records the post-fix trail, verdict 10.
